<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN PREMIERSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN PREMIERSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian premiership</p>
<p>rugby league matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Illawarra	14  South Queensland    6</p>
<p> Newcastle	29  Parramatta	   10</p>
<p> Balmain	  28  Western Suburbs     0</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> South Sydney    4  St George	    34</p>
<p> Gold Coast     16  North Sydney	 20</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p> Manly	    34  Sydney City	  24</p>
<p>Premiership standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, points for, against, total points):</p>
<p> Manly		  5    5    0    0   114    72    10</p>
<p> Newcastle	    5    4    0    1   132    66     8</p>
<p> Illawarra	    5    3    1    1   108    64     7</p>
<p> Sydney City	  5    3    0    2   100    80     6</p>
<p> St George	    5    3    0    2    92    53     6</p>
<p> North Sydney	 5    2    1    2    88    76     5</p>
